# Resolve the complete human-facing dependency declaration, then constrain its
# direct dependencies to the versions exercised by the macOS Python 3.11 job.
-r requirements.txt

# Core/tested runtime dependencies. NumPy stays on the final 1.x release
# because Essentia's macOS 11 arm64 wheel was built against the NumPy 1.x ABI.
# Its NumPy-2-compatible arm64 successor requires macOS 15, which would raise
# the app's effective minimum OS without changing its bundle metadata.
